### ============================================================
### KerjaYuk v1.1 — Pengujian API (REST Client VS Code)
### Jalankan request berurutan dari atas ke bawah.
### Token otomatis tertangkap lewat response reference {{name.response.body.token}}
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 0. Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### ============================================================
### 1. AUTENTIKASI (AC-3: Token Versioning)
### ============================================================

### 1a. Login RECRUITER (token disimpan sebagai {{loginRecruiter...}})
# @name loginRecruiter
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "recruiter@kerjayuk.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1b. Login PELAMAR (token disimpan sebagai {{loginPelamar...}})
# @name loginPelamar
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pelamar@kerjayuk.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1c. Cek sesi (wajib login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

### ============================================================
### 2. LOWONGAN (AC-5: Paginasi limit max 50 + tie-breaker created_at)
### ============================================================

### 2a. Daftar lowongan — paginasi normal (page 1, 10 baris)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lowongan?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

### 2b. Daftar lowongan — client minta 999, HARUS ter-cuk ke 50 (cek meta.limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lowongan?limit=999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

### 2c. Daftar lowongan — hanya yang masih buka
GET {{baseUrl}}/lowongan?status=buka
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

### 2d. Buat lowongan baru (RECRUITER)
# @name createLowongan
POST {{baseUrl}}/lowongan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRecruiter.response.body.token}}

{
  "judul": "Backend Developer",
  "deskripsi": "Membangun API Express.js + PostgreSQL",
  "perusahaan": "KerjaYuk Tech"
}

### 2e. Tutup lowongan yang baru dibuat (is_open -> false)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lowongan/{{createLowongan.response.body.lowongan.id}}/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRecruiter.response.body.token}}

### 2f. Pelamar mencoba melamar lowongan yang SUDAH DITUTUP (harap 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lamaran
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

{
  "lowonganId": "{{createLowongan.response.body.lowongan.id}}"
}

### ============================================================
### 3. LAMARAN — PENDAFTARAN (PELAMAR)
### ============================================================

### 3a. Ambil satu lowongan yang masih buka (ganti manual bila perlu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lowongan?status=buka&limit=1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

### 3b. Pelamar mendaftar (ganti lowonganId dengan id dari 3a)
# @name applyJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/lamaran
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

{
  "lowonganId": "GANTI-DENGAN-ID-LOWONGAN"
}

### 3c. Melamar LAGI di lowongan yang sama (harap 409 — unique constraint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lamaran
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

{
  "lowonganId": "GANTI-DENGAN-ID-LOWONGAN"
}

### 3d. Daftar lamaran milik pelamar (paginasi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lamaran?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

### ============================================================
### 4. UPDATE STATUS LAMARAN (AC-1 CAS + AC-2 Status Adaptif)
### Ganti :id dengan id lamaran, sesuaikan current_version & status lama.
### ============================================================

### 4a. Update status DIPROSES -> DITERIMA (CAS sukses, version 1 -> 2)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lamaran/GANTI-DENGAN-ID-LAMARAN/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRecruiter.response.body.token}}

{
  "status_baru": "DITERIMA",
  "current_version": 1,
  "notes": "Kandidat lolos tahap teknis"
}

### 4b. Kirim ULANG current_version LAMA = 1 (harap 409 Conflict — CAS)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lamaran/GANTI-DENGAN-ID-LAMARAN/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRecruiter.response.body.token}}

{
  "status_baru": "DITOLAK",
  "current_version": 1
}

### 4c. Ubah ke DITOLAK dengan versi terbaru (version 2)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lamaran/GANTI-DENGAN-ID-LAMARAN/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRecruiter.response.body.token}}

{
  "status_baru": "DITOLAK",
  "current_version": 2,
  "notes": "Belum sesuai kualifikasi saat ini"
}

### 4d. UNDO: DITOLAK -> DIPROSES TANPA notes (harap 400 — AC-2)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lamaran/GANTI-DENGAN-ID-LAMARAN/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRecruiter.response.body.token}}

{
  "status_baru": "DIPROSES",
  "current_version": 3,
  "notes": ""
}

### 4e. UNDO: DITOLAK -> DIPROSES DENGAN notes (harap sukses — AC-2)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lamaran/GANTI-DENGAN-ID-LAMARAN/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRecruiter.response.body.token}}

{
  "status_baru": "DIPROSES",
  "current_version": 3,
  "notes": "Evaluasi ulang: kandidat menambah portofolio baru"
}

### 4f. Riwayat log perubahan status (audit undo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lamaran/GANTI-DENGAN-ID-LAMARAN/log
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRecruiter.response.body.token}}

### ============================================================
### 5. LOGOUT & REVOKASI TOKEN (AC-3)
### ============================================================

### 5a. Logout pelamar (token_version di DB +1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

### 5b. Pakai token LAMA setelah logout (harap 401 — sesi dicabut)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

### ============================================================
### 6. UJI ROLE & ERROR HANDLING
### ============================================================

### 6a. PELAMAR mencoba buat lowongan (harap 403 — hanya RECRUITER/ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lowongan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPelamar.response.body.token}}

{
  "judul": "Tidak Boleh",
  "deskripsi": "x",
  "perusahaan": "y"
}

### 6b. Endpoint tidak dikenal (harap 404 JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tidak-ada

### 6c. Body rusak / tanpa field wajib (harap 400 JSON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}
